
@page "/cloud-payroll"

<PageTitle>Cloud Payroll | H2 Payroll</PageTitle>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-overlay">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-kicker"><span>CLOUD</span> PAYROLL</h2>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="solution-detail-header">
            <p>
                H2 Cloud Payroll is easy to deploy and ensures that setup can be done immediately.
            </p>
            <p>
                ​Customers can benefit from a secure and scalable architecture without having to go 
                through complex and time consuming software and hardware installations.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="solution-detail-grid">
            <article class="cloud-card-grid" style="--cloud-index: 0">
                <h2 class="card-title">No Capital Cost <br /> No Maintenance Cost</h2>

                <p>
                    No investment in software or computers is required. No additional computer 
                    support or upgrades are needed.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="cloud-card-grid" style="--cloud-index: 1">
                <h2 class="card-title">Always the Latest Version of the Software</h2>

                <p>
                    With H2 Cloud Payroll, clients always have access to the latest version of 
                    the software.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="cloud-card-grid" style="--cloud-index: 2">
                <h2 class="card-title">Anytime Anywhere</h2>

                <p>
                    Users can conveniently access our software anytime and anywhere.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="cloud-card-grid" style="--cloud-index: 3">
                <h2 class="card-title">Provide Centralized Information</h2>

                <p>
                    H2 Cloud Payroll captures and provides comprehensive information about each 
                    employee’s entire employment life cycle at the touch of a button. It maintains 
                    a centralized record system containing current and historical information for 
                    both active and inactive employees.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="cloud-card-grid" style="--cloud-index: 4">
                <h2 class="card-title">Accurate Reporting</h2>

                <p>
                    With H2 Cloud Payroll, organizations can rely on accurate reporting. Role-based 
                    access rights and an approval authorization process help prevent duplicate entries, 
                    reduce errors, and minimize the risk of fraud.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="price-band" id="contact">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="price-inner">
            <div>
                <span class="section-kicker light-kicker">
                    LET'S TALK
                </span>

                <h2>
                    Make payroll simpler
                    <br />
                    for your business.
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Tell us about your team and what you need.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="price-box-section">
                <div class="price-box">
                    <h3>Let's connect</h3>

                    <p>
                        We'd be happy to learn about your requirements.
                    </p>
                    <br />
                    <div class="contact-list">
                        <a href="mailto:HR@h2software.net">HR@h2software.net</a>
                        <a href="mailto:sales@h2software.net">sales@h2software.net</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
